  "description": "The ZFS_IOC_SET_PROP ioctl, used by zfs-set(8), incorrectly validated the calling user such that an unprivileged user is able to set metadata on a dataset indicating that the dataset has received properties from a zfs-recv(8) stream.\n\nAny local user can set the internal ZFS metadata flag \"$hasrecvd\" on datasets via ZFS_IOC_SET_PROP.",
